       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "History/interval focus [BF4‑EC, \"2 Year Visit\"]:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " family functioning and stressors; major family changes; a complete review of systems (head/eyes/ears/breathing/abdomen/skin; development — muscle strength, movement, language). Assess "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "parental/caregiver concerns about development, learning, or behavior"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "."
     }
    ]
   },
