     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " ocular motility, pupils (red reflexes/opacification), visual acuity by fixate‑and‑follow; mouth (caries, plaque, white‑spot demineralization, staining, gingivitis); abdomen (masses); skin (nevi, café‑au‑lait spots, birthmarks, bruising); neurologic (observe running, scribbling, socialization, following commands; language acquisition/clarity)."
     }
    ]
